msgid "You need a connection to change who has access."
msgstr "Чтобы изменить доступ, нужно подключение к сети."

#. Shown when saving a new name failed for lack of a connection.
#: src/screens/AccountScreen.tsx
msgid "You need a connection to change your name."
msgstr "Чтобы изменить имя, нужно подключение к сети."

#. Shown when deleting the account failed for lack of a connection.
#: src/screens/AccountScreen.tsx
msgid "You need a connection to delete your account."
msgstr "Чтобы удалить учетную запись, нужно подключение к сети."

#. Shown when the list of blocked people could not load for lack of a connection.
#: src/screens/BlockedPeopleScreen.tsx
msgid "You need a connection to see who you've blocked."
msgstr "Чтобы увидеть заблокированных пользователей, нужно подключение к сети."

#. Shown when the notifications could not load for lack of a connection.
#: src/screens/NotificationsScreen.tsx
msgid "You need a connection to see your notifications."
msgstr "Чтобы увидеть уведомления, нужно подключение к сети."

#. Shown when saving the name failed for lack of a connection.
#: src/screens/SetNameScreen.tsx
msgid "You need a connection to set your name."
msgstr "Чтобы задать имя, нужно подключение к сети."

#. Shown when unblocking someone failed for lack of a connection.
#: src/screens/BlockedPeopleScreen.tsx
msgid "You need a connection to unblock someone."
msgstr "Чтобы разблокировать пользователя, нужно подключение к сети."

#. A change made earlier, refused when it reached the server: the role changed meanwhile.
#: src/lib/listsApi.ts
msgid "You no longer have permission to make that change."
msgstr "У Вас больше нет прав на это изменение."

#. Above the sign-in form after this device was signed out from another one. Keep it to one line.
#: src/screens/SignInScreen.tsx
msgid "You were signed out on another device."
msgstr "Выполнен выход на другом устройстве."

#. The confirm before leaving a list, or removing yourself from it: what it costs.
